/**
 * @module
 * Lowering of expressions, operators and statements (stage 0:
 * bootstrap/src/air/lower_expr.c, lower_ops.c, lower_stmt.c,
 * lower_struct.c). Integer arithmetic is checked (spec 2.2): every check is
 * an explicit assertion.
 */

